# Your own packages, always included in every build.
# Add one package per line and rebuild. Examples:
#
# isc-kea-dhcp4-server     # DHCP server for the LAN
# pppoe                    # PPPoE WAN
# frr                      # alternative routing suite
# prometheus-node-exporter
# htop
#
# Local .deb files go in packages/debs/ and are installed automatically.
